<title>MONACO: TENNIS-SAMPRAS SETS TOUR POINTS RECORD.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SAMPRAS SETS TOUR POINTS RECORD.</headline>
<dateline>MONTE CARLO 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Pete Sampras set a record for the highest number of points in the world tennis rankings with 5,774 following his win at the Australian Open, the ATP Tour said on Monday.</p>
<p>The previous record was set by fellow American Andre Agassi with 5,652 points on August 28, 1995.</p>
